      "color": "#64748b",
      "speakerId": "0a3f02b0-80bb-5e10-8f8d-897f9e479f2a",
      "content": "감독님은 항상 차분하시네요.\n저도 그렇게 되고 싶어요.",
      "statements": [],
      "childFlowId": null,
      "labelIds": [],
      "translations": {
        "content": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "You're always so calm, Coach.\nI want to be like that too.",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "3f243c3c-ae4f-514e-bd22-3fcf9f041245",
      "type": "Comment",
      "name": "Comment",
      "localId": 4,
      "x": 340,
      "y": -220,
      "color": "#64748b",
      "text": "면담 이벤트 설정",
      "width": 260,
      "height": 110,
      "attachments": [
        {
          "nodeId": "aaaa5b36-1e7e-5717-b34a-93ddc74348c4"
        }
      ],
      "sharedValues": {
